<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <title>David Laganière</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0059b3">
  <meta name="Description" content="Front page of David Laganière.">
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  {% css %}
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Mona Sans';
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 100 900;
    font-display: swap;
    src: url('/fonts/MonaSansVF[wdth,wght,opsz,ital].woff2') format('woff2');
  }
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Mona Sans Mono';
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 100 900;
    font-display: swap;
    src: url('/fonts/MonaSansMonoVF[wdth,wght].woff2') format('woff2');
  }

  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Mona Sans fallback';
    src: local('Arial'), local('Helvetica Neue'), local('Helvetica'), local('sans-serif');
    ascent-override: 109%;
    descent-override: 32%;
    line-gap-override: 0%;
  }

  body {
    background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #e3e3e3 0, #e3e3e3 1px, white 0, white 50%);
    background-size: 10px 10px;
    font-family: 'Mona Sans', 'Mona Sans fallback', sans-serif;
  }

  .container {
    margin: 70px auto;
    background: #dde7f9;
    /*background: #e3e3e3;*/
    /*background: #ffffff;*/
    color: #323335;
    border-radius: 5px;
    width: 440px;
    text-align: center;
    /*box-shadow: 0 10px 20px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75);*/
  }

  .photo {
    width: 112px;
    height: 120px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    margin: -20px 0 0 -275px;
    border: 1px solid #155b94;
    padding: 2px;
    background: #155b94;
  }

  .name-container {
    margin: -90px 0 0 160px;
    display: flex;
    flex-flow: column wrap;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .name {
    background-color: #155b94;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 25px;
    font-weight: bold;
    padding-left: 2px;
    padding-right: 2px;
    margin: 0 0 5px 0;
  }

  .title {
    background-color: #155b94;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: normal;
    padding-left: 2px;
    padding-right: 2px;
    margin: 0 0 0 0;
  }

  .about {
    text-align: left;
    padding: 25px;
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  .social-container {
    padding: 0 0 25px 0;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .link-text {
    border: 0;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    position: absolute !important;
    height: 1px; 
    width: 1px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .linkedin-container {
    padding-right: 5px;
  }

  .linkedin-icon {
    height: 32px;
    width: 32px;
  }

  .linkedin-icon rect {
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .linkedin-icon path {
    color: #333;
  }

  .github-icon {
    height: 32px;
    width: 32px;
  }

  .github-icon path {
    color: #333;
  }

  .github-icon circle {
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 420px) {
    .container {
      width: 320px;
    }

    .photo {
      width: 93px;
      height: 100px;
      margin: -20px 0 0 -200px;
    }

    .name-container {
      margin: -70px 0 0 120px;
    }

    .name {
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .title {
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .linkedin-icon {
      height: 48px;
      width: 48px;
      padding-right: 15px;
    }

    .github-icon {
      height: 48px;
      width: 48px;
    }
  }
  {% endcss %}
  <style>{% getBundle "css" %}</style>
  <script async src="https://umami.davidlaganiere.com/script.js" data-website-id="055c750c-8baf-41a7-af1e-82e3925dab5e"></script>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <img src="/photo.webp" class="photo" alt="Illustration of David Laganière" />
      <div class="name-container">
        <h1 class="name">David Laganière</h1>
        <h2 class="title">ingénieur, Professional Engineer</h2>
      </div>
    </header>
    <main>
      <p class="about">
        I'm a senior engineer with nearly two decades in telecommunications, currently focused on platform reliability, observability, and full-stack development. I care about the details that most people skip: security, user experience, maintainability, and the kind of code that doesn't come back to haunt you six months later.<br>
        <br>
        I work across the full stack and across the full lifecycle — from containerization and infrastructure automation to frontend design and observability. I'm drawn to problems that sit at the intersection of deep domain knowledge and modern software craft, and I bring both to every project I take on.<br>
        <br>
        If that sounds like what you're looking for, let's talk.
      </p>
    </main>
    <footer>
      <div class="social-container">
        <a href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/david-lagani%C3%A8re-ing-p-eng-5a22ab4" target="_blank">
